Package: minisforum-n5-it5571-dkms
Version: @DEBVER@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: SirRenix <7069603+SirRenix@users.noreply.github.com>
Installed-Size: @SIZE@
Depends: dkms (>= 3.0), proxmox-default-headers | linux-headers-amd64
Recommends: proxmox-default-headers
Section: kernel
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/SirRenix/minisforum-n5pro-fan-proxmox
Description: IT5571 EC fan driver for the Minisforum N5 Pro (DKMS)
 The out-of-tree hwmon driver ltdstudio/minisforum-n5-it5571 (upstream
 @TAG@, commit @COMMIT@) as a DKMS module, rebuilt for every kernel whose
 headers are installed. On Proxmox VE the recommended
 proxmox-default-headers follows the default kernel series like
 proxmox-default-kernel does (proxmox-headers-<series> alone satisfies the
 dependency but stops at its series).
 .
 Enables the PWM nodes of the experimental N5 Pro profile
 (experimental_write=1) and loads the module at boot. Loading writes nothing
 to the EC; only a regulator such as n5-fangov writes.
